Z||000000||FieroPerformance||06-27-2001||12:22 AM||||Hey,<P>    I live in Cincinnati and I was just wondering how many people from the forum live around this area and what they are driving. I know there are a pretty good number of Fiero owners around here because I see the cars but I don't know how many of them are in on the forum.<P>-Charlie<BR>----<BR>85 GT 5 speed<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com||||reg||5
