Z||000011||dlancer407||06-27-2001||05:10 PM||||Hi Charlie;<BR>The recall is #88-C-24 and it covers possible engine fires on 85-87 Fiero V6 models. I found the recall on the Michigan Fiero web site. ( <A HREF="http://www.michiganfieroclub.org" TARGET=_blank>www.michiganfieroclub.org</A>  )<BR>You can print out the whole recall notice it is 12 pages long.The good thing about it for me is, my front side exhaust manifold has a leak or crack in it and under the recall they put a new one on there.<BR>||||reg||7
