Z||000043||87ECO5||07-03-2001||07:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Anyone here from Marion, IN with a red fastback??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That was Lisa and I, Dave!  We moved and bought another one!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   j/k<P>Regarding the idea of a Fiero cruise-in around Cinci ... those of you familiar with these places (Yesterday's, Jolly's, etc.), give me some information on them.  Do they have regular cruise-ins (every weekend)?  Friday or Saturday nights?  Location?<P>Also, Springboro has a monthly car show (every first Saturday of the month, from May to September or October).  It's REAL easy to get to (less than a mile from I-75 on SR73).  No admission fees (also no awards), music, LOTS of cars of all makes and models (last month brought in over 100), and it's close to several food places.  It's also within about 15 miles of my favorite cruise roads.  We could have a <B>strong</B> Fiero presence at the show, then head out and take a beautiful trip through Fort Ancient.  Several of us took the same trip back in February of last year.  A little too much salt and snow on the roads but cool none-the-less.<P>Anyway, give me some information and I'll try to throw something together.<P>Charlie, it's been killing me since you first started this thread.  I recognize your email address but I can't for the life of me figure out where I've seen it before!!!!!||||reg||14
Z||000044||FieroPerformance||07-03-2001||03:00 PM||||87ECO5,<P>     I am not sure where you have seen my email address before.<P>charlie@fieroperformance.com no longer works, I used that email to sell PFF window decals for a while.<P>My new email is jackalrr@hotmail.com you have have seen the jackalrr before from my old web page <A HREF="http://www.foakleys.com" TARGET=_blank>www.foakleys.com</A>  ? Ever buy a window decal or fake oakley sunglasses from me? That might be it.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000045||dlancer407||07-05-2001||08:08 AM||||87ECO5; I called it Yesterdays but it is actually Yesteryears, My bad. It is located on Northland Blvd. in the Tricounty area of Cincinnati. It is wery easy to get to off of I-275 and I-75. They have there's every Wednesday evening all summer long. as long as the weather is good they have a pretty good turn out with some parking lot parking and a large grassy area that holds a lot of cars.If we all decide to meet there I can give anyone better directions from the interstates.<BR>                     Dennis||||reg||1
